Keep the credit available for as long as you distribute or make available
the relevant product or work. One appropriate credit per product is enough;
you do not need a separate credit for every experiment used.

Private study, local experimentation, and internal use that does not involve
distribution or public availability do not require a public-facing credit.
This license does not impose obligations on ideas, independently written
